            "description": {
              "value": "You are among the most common of changelings—those born to green hags—and a vibrant green eye signifies that parentage.\n\nYour mother's manipulative nature and versatile voice gives you an edge when deceiving others. You gain the Charming Liar skill feat. If you roll Deception for initiative, foes in that combat encounter that haven't acted yet are flat-footed against you."
